-shots_on_goal_difference_per_match,team,metrics.shots_on_goal_difference_per_match.label,Ø Shots on goal difference,Average shots-on-target difference per match (on target for - against). The best non-outcome predictor of league position; the deserved process signal behind deserved-vs-actual. Null unless both own and opponent shots-on-target data cover every season game.,int_legs__team_match,sum(shots_on_goal - opponent_shots_on_goal),count(*),expression,false,decimal_1,shooting,1,higher_better,On-target dominance - on-target shots created minus conceded per game; high = the process deserves results (deserved-vs-actual input)
